\enum Filesystem::EAssetType
\ingroup filesystem
\brief The kind of file an asset is, set from its extension by `filesystem.json`. `UNDEFINED` when the extension is not listed.

Declared at \src{include/Filesystem/FilesystemTypes.hpp,18,26}. `CONFIG` is never assigned at this commit; config files get their type from their extension like any other file.
