\struct SAsset
\ingroup filesystem
\brief Base type of everything the Filesystem module can load. Derive from it to make your own asset types.

`AssetPath` and the name are filled in by `LoadFile`. Declared at \src{include/Filesystem/FilesystemTypes.hpp,51,65}.

